    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8af3246fed150b4",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6cdbda82ad7d5ca",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder-Prompted",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1201941d0a78c11",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder 的一个有趣之处在于它是多语言的，因此我们在 MultiPL-E（把 HumanEval 扩展到许多其他语言）上评估了它。我们观察到 StarCoder 在许多语言上与 code-cushman-001 相当或更好。在一个叫 DS-1000 的数据科学基准上，它明显超过后者及所有其他开放获取模型。不过，除了代码补全，这个模型还能做什么！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "471beb6fd415398e",
      "translationZh": "技术助手",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9f782a38815656c",
      "translationZh": "通过穷尽的评估我们发现 StarCoder 非常会写代码。但我们也想测试它能否用作技术助手——毕竟它训练时读了大量文档和 GitHub issue。受 Anthropic 的 HHH 提示启发，我们构建了一个 Tech Assistant Prompt。令人惊喜的是，仅凭这个提示，模型就能扮演技术助手并回答编程相关的请求！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "acef4e991a0b6417",
      "translationZh": "训练数据",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73dfc5c96806317e",
      "translationZh": "模型在 The Stack 1.2 的子集上训练。该数据集只包含宽松许可的代码，并包含退出流程，代码贡献者可以把他们的数据从数据集中移除（见 Am I in The Stack）。与 Toloka 合作，我们从训练数据中移除了姓名、密码、电子邮件地址等个人可识别信息（PII）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1453b54b7a6bc24",
      "translationZh": "关于 BigCode",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "234a558967f6e3a5",
      "translationZh": "BigCode 是由 Hugging Face 与 ServiceNow 共同领导的开放科学协作，致力于负责任地开发面向代码的大语言模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
